{"version":1,"content":"<p>繼美國推動TikTok美國業務脱離中國母公司字節跳動（ByteDance）的控制之後，歐洲也開始出現類似的政治主張。德國和奧地利近日聯合提出倡議，希望將TikTok在歐洲的業務轉移至歐洲資本控制之下，並要求其他歐盟成員國加入這一行動。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587320.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:24:32.590426+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T17:09:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T17:17:39.549462+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T17:17:39.549462+00:00","content_hash":"38aa8b80c4a192702ed974a03c09b105552a0bf0b9ef238ee17cae627531cf2d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}